  "policy_id": "reported-events-exact-gazetteer:v1",
  "purpose": "Synthetic task evaluation and resolver regression cases only. These messages are invented and must never be imported as real intelligence.",
  "limitations": [
    "A small development/holdout set, not a production accuracy or calibration claim.",
    "Expected proposals include deliberate invalid model outputs to verify deterministic abstention; they are not all ideal AI extractions.",
    "City points indicate approximate publisher city locations, never observed incident-site coordinates.",
    "Independent confirmation is always false for these isolated messages; copies and quotations do not create corroboration.",
    "Three cases are explicitly resolver-only: their deliberately incorrect proposals must not be used as desired model extraction outputs. The other 21 are eligible for semantic model evaluation (13 development, 8 holdout)."
